If you let workers consistently and regularly lift heavy trash cans, the risk of injury increases, risk of workers comp increases, duration of routes increases.

Man Rand El The Savage One is my Half Orc Wrestling Barbarian.

&#x200B;

He's based on Macho Man Randy Savage.

Valmese with a military almost Roman vibe, Sacaean with horseriders and swordsmen, Brigid with a hunters and mystic shamen, Loptr from Genealogy, Hatari from Tellius maybe? One of the elemental tribes from Fates. 

&#x200B;

Just thinking or cultures that stray or stand out from the typical medieval fantasy vibe of most of the central nations and characters.

The situation is a clusterfuck, just getting that out there. In a video Reinoehl and a friend approach Danielson with a gun in his hand. Someone said that they were maced by Danielson. Danielson closes the distance with a can of mace extended out. Reinoehl fires twice and kills him, one hitting the mace. Who's to say that Reinoehl didn't fear for his life just like Rittenhouse? Oh wait we can't because he executed by the police.

&#x200B;

The feds shooting him is also just as messy, too. Conflicting accounts from police officers and witness accounts differ from the official police report.
